# A Luxel library scene (Gitea #785) — Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# The two-layer scene: something moving underneath, the time on top, and a
# colour ramp so the pattern reads as one palette with the clock.
S - Clock over Aurora
L pat 0 0 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Aurora
I @pat/aurora-2d
R 70 0:001028 90:1e6f8c 200:7fe3c8 255:ffffff
L text 0 2 0 0 normal 100 black fill 1
N Time
T clock HH:MM
F large ffffff c none 0
